2.2.2
https://github.com/CodyTolene/pip-boy-3000-holotapes/pull/92
- Quick patch to support the new Pip-Boy OS v1.1.6 update regarding persistent audio.

2.2.1
https://github.com/CodyTolene/pip-boy-3000-holotapes/pull/85
Features:
- Replaced the optional image and sound intro with a RobCo style typed startup sequence.
- Limited Persistent Audio to Pip-Boy software v1.1.5, where it is supported. Added a message for other versions.
- Updated the Holotape image to display on the Pip-Boy.
- Moved APP.JS and APP.MIN.JS into the assets folder.
- Rename the app to "RobCo Entmt. Terminal" for a one-liner title on the Pip-Boy.
Fixed issues from 2.2.0:
- Restored the current song and playlist name display, long-name shortening, and brought back the volume bar.
- Restored the playlist arrows, Shuffle and Play All status messages, active playback markers, and the full "NO PLAYLISTS FOUND" help message.
- Fixed the waveform animation smooth again (50ms over 160ms refresh).
- Fixed Z-A song sorting.

2.2.0
https://github.com/CodyTolene/pip-boy-3000-holotapes/pull/82
- Rebuilt the music list, removed pagination.
- Added optional Persistent Audio, off by default, so a playlist can continue while using other Pip-Boy screens.

2.1.0
https://github.com/CodyTolene/pip-boy-3000-holotapes/pull/58
- Update name of app from "iPip Media Player" to "RobCo Entertainment Terminal"
- Add new sleep timer option to the Music menu (SETTINGS.JS).
- Add native `.IMG` image support to the image viewer (IMAGES.JS).
- Make the startup image and sound optional.
- Update app icon, and add preview mp3 and mp4 files for web previews.

2.0.0
https://github.com/CodyTolene/pip-boy-3000-holotapes/pull/53
- Turn iPip into a full media player with music, video, and image support.
- Add a menu (MUSIC, VIDEOS, IMAGES).
- Move the music player to its own screen.
- Add a video player.
- Add an image viewer.
- Create the "VIDEOS" and "IMAGES" folders automatically on launch if missing.

1.2.1
https://github.com/CodyTolene/pip-boy-3000-holotapes/pull/27
- Create the "MUSIC" folder automatically on launch if it is missing so the app no longer fails to load.
- Show a "NO PLAYLISTS FOUND" message linking to pip-boy.com when no station playlists exist.

1.2.0
https://github.com/CodyTolene/pip-boy-3000-holotapes/pull/25
- On long press/hold of the left wheel button, open the settings menu. Close with another long hold.
- Sorting functionality button moved into the new settings menu.
- New setting added for controlling screen brightness from the settings menu.
- New setting for controlling audio volume from the settings menu.
- Read version dynamically from "APPINFO/IPIP.info" instead of hardcoding it in the app.
- Restore volume to system settings on exit.
- Restore brightness to system settings on exit.

