https://github.com/CodyTolene/pip-boy-3000-holotapes/pull/23
- Update "RANDOM" button to be "SHUFFLE PLAY ALL" for the random play mode.
- Add new button "SORT A-Z", "SORT Z-A" that sorts the songs in the current playlist.
- Add new button "PLAY ALL" that plays all songs in the list in the current order.

